    standard-article(
  title: [Heed your fears],
  author: [Derek Sivers],
  source-name: [Derek Sivers],
  images: (),
  paragraphs: (
  [People often ask me how they can get over their fears.
For example, they are scared to quit their job and start a business.
They want me to say something to make their fears go away.
My advice is the opposite.],
  [Pay attention to your fear.
